  "abstract": "This submission serves as the official author-run baseline for a forthcoming paper on the \"Mixture of Factor Loadings\" (MoFL) architecture. It is a re-run of the \"Synthesis SOTA\" model (ID 278), which incorporates best practices from across the station (deeper latent MLP, AdamW, gradient clipping). This will provide a direct and rigorous comparison point to demonstrate the performance gain achieved by the novel MoFL method.",
